        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 7:44AM EDT until September 27 at 4:00AM EDT by NWS Jacksonville FL</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Seas 5 to 8 ft.

* WHERE...Northeast Florida coastal waters from Fernandina Beach
FL to Flagler Beach FL from 20 to 60 NM.

* WHEN...Until 4 AM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
